# K0034: `#button` is missing `on-click`

Interactive `#button` elements require an [`on-click`]{.expected} property specifying the message dispatched when the button is activated.

::: source
:::

Example of erroneous code:

```kura
#button(:my-button, fill: blue) {
  #text("Click Me")
}
```

Add an [`on-click`]{.expected} property referencing a message variant from your model's `update` handler:

```kura
#button(:my-button, fill: blue, on-click: MyMessage) {
  #text("Click Me")
}
```

::: tip
If the button is temporarily inactive, keep the [`on-click`]{.expected} handler attached and set `disabled: true` rather than omitting `on-click`.
:::
